:: ANewStart {"position":"700,100","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-header">
        <div class="system-alert">!</div>
        <div class="system-title">Notification</div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-content">
        During a monster attack you were hand picked by the overlord the monsters leader after your entire squad had been killed, and he proposed to you a choice.
        
        Do you want to live and get stronger? If not, your heart will stop imminently in 0.001 seconds.

        <br><br>
       (link: "Accept")[(goto: "OverlordMessage")]
      (link: "Decline")[(goto: "Play Menu")]
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: Agree {"position":"2700,600","size":"100,100"}
<div class="SpeechBox">
    <div class="SpeechName">Player.</div>

    <div class="Speech">
   You haven't been suffering. 
      
  <p>
       I will  teach you suffering when I kill you!
   <p>      
       
  </div>
  </div>
</div>

(after: 8s)[(goto: "TimeToTrainThen")]


:: Another Day {"position":"3100,900","size":"100,100"}
<div class="menu">
  <div class="menu-card">
    <div class="menu-title">Next Day</div>

    <div class="menu-buttons">
      (link: "Continue")[(goto: "EnterWormhole")]
