:: Another Quest {"position":"300,1600","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-header">
        <div class="system-alert">!</div>
        <div class="system-title"> Letter From The Overlord</div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-content">
       <p>
       A new quest...
       </p>
       
       <p>
       Dear Player,
       </p>
       
       <p>
       I am formally inviting you to my dimesnion within the wormhole. 
       <p>
       
       <p>
       Your mission: To discover if you truly are worthy enough to battle.
     <p>
     
     <p>
     If you fail to be worthy... You shall die!
       <p>
       
         (link: "Accept")[(goto: "DescriptionOfWormhole")]
        
        
        <br><br>
       
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: Boss Monster {"position":"4100,1300","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">
      <div class="system-content">
    It's mighty thump leads vibrations to course through you with every step the Boss beast takes. It's giant. It's... hideous.
    
    <p>
    It snarls with drool escaping it's vicious chops. Your eyes dart to focus on the razor-sharp teeth it posesses. Next, you notice it's tallons, and it's warty skin. All these aspects petrify you.
    
    <p>
    Sweat drips down your flushed face, as you realise it will be impossible to beat this massive Boss Monster.
    
    <p>
    In knowing this, you still proceed to draw your sword.
    
    <p>
    You charge at the beast...

[[See What Happens]]


   </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: Can'tSee {"position":"1500,800","size":"100,100"}
