    <div class="SpeechName">Player.</div>

    <div class="Speech">
    Wait?!
    <p>
    You can't see this?
    <p>
          <div class="SpeechContinueButton">
       
  </div>
  </div>
</div>

(after: 5s)[(goto: "SeeWhat?")]


:: Complete Quest 2 {"position":"2300,900","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-header">
        <div class="system-alert">!</div>
        <div class="system-title">Overlord</div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-content">
       <p>
       Well done you have completed the quest!
       <p>
       
       <p>
       You have gotten stronger. Therefore, you will be able to to complete quest 1.
       </p>
 
       
   
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>

(after: 7s)[(goto: "TimeSkip")]


:: DescriptionOfOverlord {"position":"700,1600","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-content">
       <p>
       This tall overpowering figure emerged from the dusky atmosphere. Goosebumps began to send shivers through me. His flesh was armour. Solid. Untouchable.
       </p>
       
       <p>
       As he walked toward me with pride, I could notice the many weapons he weilded. I scoured his entire body, but his feet weren't visible due to the inky fog that blanketed this dimension's floors.
       <p>
       
       <p>
   The Overlord continued in his stride towards me until he lurched over me and halted. His serpent eyes met mine, peircing my soul.  He shared the same snarl as his monsters.
       <p>

       (link: "Continue")[(goto: "Welcome")]
       
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: DescriptionOfWormhole {"position":"500,1600","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-content">
      <p>
      The wormhole loomed above me, as I vastly approached it. The pulsing white glow in the centre of this luminous blue swirl faintly called to me. 
      <p>
  
  <p>
  This is it! I am going to fight him...
  <p>
  
       <p>
 For the sake of humanity.
       </p>

       (link: "Continue")[(goto: "DescriptionOfOverlord")]
       
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: Do what the Nurse says {"position":"2300,600","size":"100,100"}
