:: EnterRoom1 {"position":"1700,200","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">
      <div class="system-content">
      
            <p>
        You are now adventuring in a unknown wormhole to another world, which is made just for you. Strangely, it looks identical to the real world, but more rotted, showing the reality of the world you live in.
      </p>
      
            <p>
       You hear a noise... It sounds like growling.
      </p>
      
      [[Investigate]]
        [[Go back to entrance]]
       
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


