:: Fight {"position":"2100,300","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">
      <div class="system-content">
      
            <p>
     You have chosen to fight the monsters in the dungeon. 
      </p>
     5 beasts begin to surround you. The overlord has abandoned you, weaponless. After attempting to strike down the monsters with your hands, you have plummetted to the ground. 
            <p>

      </p>
      
      (link: "Run")[(goto: "Investigate")]
        [[Search]]
       
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: FightScene1 {"position":"2900,1600","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">
      <div class="system-content">
      
            <p>
        The Overlord charges at you. You fight back with a defencive block. He still charging at you like there is no tomorrow. You counter and attack back slicing and dicing. The Overlord overwelmed trips and falls and in a split second you slash his heart. And smiles.
      </p>
      

(after: 10s)[(goto: "PlayerPride")]
       
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


