:: Investigate {"position":"1900,100","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-header">
        <div class="system-alert">!</div>
        <div class="system-title">A Monster has appeared.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-content">
       
       <p>
       You see the monster with your eyes. Your body is frozen still and unable to move. Your eyes are spinning around and around desperately looking for a way to hide, or something to use to defend yourself with. 
       </p>
       
              <p>
       You found a stick. In terror, you charged at the monster, smashing it's head  repeatedly until it stopped moving.
       </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  (after: 25s)[(goto: "TheManyToKill")]


:: Investigate it {"position":"2900,1100","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-header">
        <div class="system-alert">!</div>
        <div class="system-title">A Monster has appeared.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-content">
       
       <p>
       You see the monster with your eyes fixated on it's distortion. Your body is frozen still and unable to move. Your eyes are flickering corner to corner, desperately looking for a way to hide, or something to use to defend yourself with. 
       </p>
       
              <p>
       You found a stick. In terror, you charged at the monster, smashing it's head  repeatedly until it stopped moving.
       </p>
   
   
     (link: "Continue")[(goto: "Another Day")]
   
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
    </div>
    </div>


:: KeepFight {"position":"4000,1100","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">
      <div class="system-content">
You battle with all you have. Every inch of your straining body feels heavier, making you contemplate giving up.


<p>
But you don't.


<p>
You keep at it. Your eyes struggle to remain open, your vision blurrs. Squinting, you can see 2 tunnels. Possibly one of them can lead to an escape. An end. 

<p>
It seems you are making progress, weakening your opponents. You must push yourself in hope of freedom. With a struggle, you can vaguely read that one of the tunnels leads to the "boss monster". The other tunnel is unlabelled. 


<p>
Maybe, defeating the Boss Monster could end all of this misery, but are you strong enough to take it on?





[[Run]] 
[[Boss Monster]]

  
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: Kill {"position":"3700,900","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">
      <div class="system-content">
    More monsters spawn in the dungeon. A test sent from the Overlord.  

            <p>
You must continue to slaughter, burying your sword into each and every beast within reach of your blade. 
      </p>
      
      (link: "Keep Killing")[(goto: "MoreAppeared")]
      
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: MoreAppeared {"position":"3900,900","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">
      <div class="system-content">
      Suddenly, you find yourself weakening, with hardly any will power left. 
  
            <p>
The monsters are stronger than the last, and they begin to close in on you. It feels like you are suffocating with no escape...
      </p>
      
      [[Run]] 
[[KeepFight]] 
      
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


