:: OverlordMessage {"position":"900,100","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-header">
        <div class="system-alert">!</div>
        <div class="system-title">Overlord</div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-content">
       <p>
       Welcome Player to the overlord system!
       </p>
       
       <p>
       You MUST complete quests to get stronger and raise yourself through the ranks. If   you refuse to obey or make an incorrect choice then... you shall be punished by me: the Overlord. 
       </p>
       
              <p>
       Do you understand me?
       </p>
        
        [[yes]]
       
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: OverlordOnlyWantsYouToBeStrong {"position":"2500,600","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-header">
        <div class="system-alert">!</div>
        <div class="system-title">Overlord</div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-content">
       <p>
       A new quest is available...
       </p>
       
       <p>
      All I have wanted in this messed up world is a rival.
      One who can bring me down to my knees and free me from this endless suffering.
       </p>
       
       <p>
       For millenias I have searched. I had hoped you would be the one with enough potential to battle me.
       <p>
       [[Agree]] 
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


:: OverlordTask {"position":"2100,800","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">

      <div class="system-header">
        <div class="system-alert">!</div>
        <div class="system-title">Overlord</div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-content">
       <p>
     YOU are the only one who can talk with me player. 
       </p>
      I teleported you to this hospital, as you fell flat onto the floor due to exhaustion. 
       <p>
Therefore, quest 1 is still incomplete. However... I shall not punish you. But quest 2 MUST be fully completed in order for you to become strong enough to succeed at your original quest.
       </p>
       
       [[Complete Quest 2]]
       [[Do what the Nurse says]]


