:: PlayerPowerfulSpeech {"position":"2525,1600","size":"100,100"}
<div class="SpeechBox">
    <div class="SpeechName">Player.</div>

    <div class="Speech">
    Remember when you called me unworthy? When you said I was shameful? 
    <p>
    You casted me aside like trash. Now watch as I set your world black.
    <p> 
    <p>
   Look at what I have become! I am now the strongest human alive!
 <p>   
    
    <p>
    The boy you cast aside has found a power you can’t comprehend... 
<p>
          <div class="SpeechContinueButton">
          
          (after: 15s)[(goto: "OverlordLetFight")]
       
  </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>


:: PlayerPride {"position":"3100,1600","size":"100,100"}
<div class="SpeechBox">
    <div class="SpeechName">Player.</div>

    <div class="Speech">
    You chose war against the humans, you chose your pride, now look how far this has got you.
    <p>
    
    
   <p>
   It got you an early grave.
   <p>
   
           (after: 10s)[(goto: "VictoryScreen")]
       
  </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>


:: Prologue {"position":"300,100","size":"100,100"}
<div id="system-center">
  <div class="system-rectangle is-crawl">
    <div class="crawl">
    
      <p>
        18 Years ago...
      </p>
      
       <p>
         The day that changed everything. A rift appeared in the sky with wormholes to an unknown dimension causing humanity to be in ruins. A select few humans referred to as hunters gained supernatural abilities, which could face the monsters in the  dungeons within the wormholes. During this time every human was for themselfs but then a new system was put into place which specialised in taking down the monsters and fighting for what was left of humanity. We call this system the Hunter Clans!
      </p>
      
      <P>
      You are one of these hunters.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

(after: 30s)[(goto: "Enter wormholes")]


