  <div class="system-rectangle">

    <div class="system-panel">
      <div class="system-content">
      
            <p>
     You are in search of a weapon, and find a rustic sword in the lap of a decaying skeleton.
      </p>
    You plunge the sword into the monster that managed to grab you, digging it's claws through your flesh. It squeals in pain, summoning backup from the other 4 monsters. You swing the steel through the air striking and slashing the beasts around you until... it goes quiet. 
            <p>
The monsters that once were surrounding you, now lay limp on the cold, cobblestone floor.
      </p>
      
      (link: "Hoorah!")[(goto: "TheManyToKill")]
      
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>


